       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you run into any issues or have any feedback, please let us know here or on our official support forums: https://bethesda.net/community/category/89/pc-se",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For a full list of fixes and changes, please see the list below.",
